gurative statement, not a literal suggestion.\n\n**Step 5: Conclusion.**\nThe sarcasm/hyperbole in the last sentence stems from exaggerating the messiness to an absurd extent (the coffee table hosting a garage sale) to emphasize the chaos observed.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{C}$
