e description of a "buzzy Bass" being modulated rhythmically, is the bass line itself.\n\n**Selection:** Based on the auditory evidence where a low-frequency, heavily modulated sound creates the stuttering rhythmic complexity, option B is the best fit.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{B}$
